{"html":"<h2 id=\"connect-to-database\">Connect to Database</h2>\n<h3 id=\"connect-to-localhost\">Connect to Localhost</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Connecting to the database via username(<code>-u</code>) and password(<code>-p</code>). </li>\n<li>Password can be written directly beside the <code>-p</code> switch but should be avoided to write clear text password in shell because commands are logged in shell history.</li>\n<li>When we don't mention <code>-h</code> switch it will default to localhost.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">mysql -u &lt;username&gt; -p\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"connect-to-remote-host\">Connect to Remote Host</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Specify a particular remote host by using <code>-h</code>.</li>\n<li>Specify a particular port using <code>-p</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">mysql -u &lt;username&gt; -h &lt;remote hostname&gt; -P &lt;port number&gt; -p\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"create-database\">Create Database</h2>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-mysql\">CREATE DATABASE &lt;database name&gt;;\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"create-table\">Create Table</h2>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-mysql\">CREATE TABLE &lt;table name&gt; (&lt;col1&gt; &lt;datatype&gt;, &lt;col2&gt; &lt;datatype&gt;,...);\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"show-tables\">Show Tables</h2>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-mysql\">SHOW TABLES;\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"show-databases\">Show Databases</h2>\n<div class=\"walkthrough-command\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-command\">Copy code</button><pre><code class=\"language-mysql\">SHOW DATABASES;\n</code></pre></div>\n","toc":[{"id":"connect-to-database","title":"Connect to Database","level":2},{"id":"connect-to-localhost","title":"Connect to Localhost","level":3},{"id":"connect-to-remote-host","title":"Connect to Remote Host","level":3},{"id":"create-database","title":"Create Database","level":2},{"id":"create-table","title":"Create Table","level":2},{"id":"show-tables","title":"Show Tables","level":2},{"id":"show-databases","title":"Show Databases","level":2}]}